00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.090
Kaki kanan !

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:19.840
Benar !

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.930
Kaki kiri !

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.680
Jangan berteriak perintah seperti Anda bos !

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.600
Tangan kiri !

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:26.620
Oh yeah !

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:29.270
Tangan kanan !

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.400
Ya !

